# --- editorial-build slice C additions (generated, never source) ---

# @pm/tokens copied in by scripts/prepare-build.mjs before every build, so
# Astro serves them verbatim out of public/ (ADR-0003 §8: fonts are a
# controlled constant — byte-identical to packages/tokens, never edited).
public/assets/pm/

# The snapshot-parameterized build's baked tray payload, written by
# scripts/prepare-build.mjs from PM_SNAPSHOT (fixture default, crate on the
# deploy job). Generated per build, so it must never be committed — a stale
# committed copy is the fixture-dist-onto-the-crate-plane hazard that
# @pm/astro#build's turbo env/inputs declaration exists to prevent.
src/data/snapshot.json
src/data/pdp.json
